**DIRAC
.TITLE
Analytical first-order MP2 properties
.WAVE F
.PROPER
.4INDEX
**HAMILTONIAN
#.LVCORR
.BSS
2999
.CMPEIG
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.FCKCNV
1.0D-9
**PROPERTIES
.PVC
.EFG
.DIPOLE
.EFN
.NQCC
**MOLTRA
.ACTIVE
energy -15.0 100.0 1.0
.PRPTRA
*PRPTRA
.OPERATOR
 'EFG O'
 DIAGONAL
 'ZZEFG021'
*END OF

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T, IPRNT=1, DOFOPR=T &END
 &CCENER DOCCSD=F, DOCCSDT=F &END
 &CCFOPR DOMP2G=T, DOMP2GOLD=T, NEOPER=1, NAMEE='EFG O' &END


